# class: repo-map
# schema: path | purpose | owner-role | category
# source: repo walk + per-top-level README scan
# recipe: builtin:repo-structure

backend/ | .NET 10 modular monolith — host (api/) + write-api/ + read-api/ + shared/ libraries + Dashboard.sln; ADR-0002 | backend-engineer | source
backend/api/ | Host project Dashboard.Api — composition root + sole Dockerfile + single ACA container target | backend-engineer | source
backend/write-api/ | Write endpoint group library Dashboard.WriteApi (+ Tests) — POST /api/deployments; NOTIFY dispatch | backend-engineer | source
backend/read-api/ | Read endpoint group library Dashboard.ReadApi (+ Tests) — matrix, history, discovery, SSE, /health | backend-engineer | source
backend/shared/ | Shared library Dashboard.Shared (+ Tests) — DbContext, entities, migrations, API-key middleware, NOTIFY/LISTEN, SSE writer, DTOs | backend-engineer | source
frontend/ | Angular 20 standalone+zoneless workspace; Tailwind; NgRx Signal Store | frontend-engineer | source
frontend/dashboard/ | Application shell — main.ts, styles.css, proxy.conf.json, Dockerfile (nginx static + SPA build) | frontend-engineer | source
frontend/matrix/ | @dd/matrix library — pipeline matrix + per-view templates + attribute picker | frontend-engineer | source
frontend/drawer/ | @dd/drawer library — history drawer | frontend-engineer | source
frontend/shared/ | @dd/shared library — Signal Store + API client + SSE service + models + fixtures | frontend-engineer | source
gateway/ | nginx reverse proxy — single public ingress on :8080; routing matrix; SSE pass-through tuning | devops-engineer | infra-edge
dev_env/ | Docker Compose local + scaled stacks + PowerShell start/stop scripts | devops-engineer | local-dev
docs/ | Architecture spec, mockup, ADRs, CRs, UI option docs, WBS, CI/CD integration companion | solution-architect | governance
docs/adr/ | Architecture Decision Records (ADR-0001, ADR-0002, ADR-0003) + README | solution-architect | governance
docs/cr/ | Change Requests (CR-0001..CR-0008) + README | solution-architect | governance
docs/ui/ | Mockup (deployment-dashboard.html) + 5 UI option docs (compact / focus-layout / theme / tree-topology / version-display) | frontend-engineer (mockup), solution-architect (option docs semantics) | governance
testing/ | xUnit functional + Playwright e2e + Playwright mockup-visual + PowerShell scripts + fixtures + config | qa-engineer | testing
testing/functional/ | xUnit functional API tests (run-tests.ps1 + Dashboard.Functional.Tests/) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/e2e/ | Playwright end-to-end suite (run-tests.ps1 + playwright.config.ts + scenarios/ + tests/) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/mockup-visual/ | Playwright mockup geometric invariants harness (no stack required) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/scripts/ | seed.ps1 (POST prefilled events via Ingest API) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/config/ | Test runner configs (e.g. local.json) | qa-engineer | testing
testing/fixtures/ | Shared test data (seed-data.json) | qa-engineer | testing
.github/ | GitHub-side config — actions/notify/ composite present; workflows/ planned per WBS but not yet present | devops-engineer | ci
.github/actions/notify/ | Composite action for the CI/CD notify step (per WBS §1.4.2) | devops-engineer | ci
.agents/ | engineering-team framework install (vendor-neutral) | project-manager | tooling
.agents/engineering-team/ | Framework root (core/ + adapters/ + local/ + extras/) | project-manager | tooling
.claude/ | Claude Code adapter — installed skills + agents | project-manager | tooling
CLAUDE.md | Project-instruction file — engineering-team pointer block | project-manager | governance
TODO | Repo-root TODO list (MVP backlog + Phase 2.0) | project-manager | governance
excluded | node_modules / dist / bin / obj / playwright-report / test-results / __screenshots__ — not extracted | - | excluded
